The Go rendering: a command decoding a settings document and reading two of its
three fields, one of whose types decodes itself and declares a method nothing
calls.

-- fixture.json --
{
  "symbols": {
    "Settings.Name": { "file": "target/main.go", "line": 11 },
    "Settings.Theme": { "file": "target/main.go", "line": 12 },
    "Level.UnmarshalJSON": { "file": "target/main.go", "line": 20 },
    "Level.Describe": { "file": "target/main.go", "line": 26 }
  }
